@@ -1,5 +1,15 @@
 # 0.49 release notes
 
+## [0.49.2]
+
+Use the already adopted Shared collector for tool selection, diagnostic receipts
+and archiving. Memory keeps its log inventory, redirected-parent diagnostics,
+archive path and hosted completeness output. Failed selector output remains
+available as diagnostics but cannot authorize collecting external payloads.
+The consumer fixture retains actual installer failures, archive bytes, modes,
+links, retry isolation and hosted bindings. Library APIs and stored bytes are
+unchanged; no snapshot refresh or tool setup change is required.
+
 ## [0.49.1] - 2026-10-19
 
 The independent runtime qualification runner consumes published IC Platform 0.2
